     <strong>24\/7<\/strong>\n            <span>Atención activa<\/span>\n          <\/div>\n          <div class=\"aliviax-about__stat\">\n            <strong>< 12h<\/strong>\n            <span>Tiempo medio<\/span>\n          <\/div>\n          <div class=\"aliviax-about__stat\">\n            <strong>100%<\/strong>\n            <span>Resolución<\/span>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <div class=\"aliviax-about__cta\">\n      <h2>¿Necesitas ayuda con tu pedido?<\/h2>\n      <p>Haz clic abajo para ir directamente al formulario de contacto o escríbenos directamente.<\/p>\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/ukytjt-kx.myshopify.com\/pages\/contact\" class=\"aliviax-about__btn aliviax-about__btn--primary\">Formulario de contacto<\/a>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>","color_scheme":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}}},"order":["main","rich_text_AEADdC","form","custom_liquid_CrNLnn"]}